{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/207354-emperor-for-a-day","id":207354,"title":"Emperor for a day","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-07-24T11:40:19-07:00","id":207354,"title":"Emperor for a day","content":"So, Alien Space Bats make you Emperor of all the Earth, the International Space Station, All Manmade Orbital Objects and the Moon for 24 hours. Anything you decide during those 24 hours cannot be undone by the various nation-states and corporations that return to power after the 24 hours are up. You can command the bureaucracies and militaries of all the nations and corporations. What are your priorities?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/961-chewygranola","name":"ChewyGranola","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar961_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"254"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-24T12:17:12-07:00","id":207395,"title":"","content":"1) Establish a monthly paycheck for myself that will continue to the end of my life that ensures that I can lives comfortably through pretty much anything.<br /> <br /> 2)Make Michael Bay pay back every dollar he earned from the Transformers Movie and Pearl Harbor and offer an individual apology to each person he gives back to.<br /> <br /> 3) Don't touch anything else because I don't trust my self to make the wise decisions that will help humanity become united and/or exalted.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-24T12:51:17-07:00","id":207422,"title":"","content":"My first instinct is to implement a global system of communist economics, sharing wealth more or less evenly among the nations and their people. Of course, I don't know nearly enough about who needs what in order to function, so I'd drop that idea immediately for fear of making things worse. I wouldn't feel an ounce of regret about criminalizing working conditions in Chinese sweatshop-factories, though, and I'd be damned tempted to order criminal charges be filed against the bankers and brokers responsible for the mortgage market bubble of a few years back. I'd probably also decree that fedoras are not only worn by dickbags so I could wear one without feeling self-conscious.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-24T13:46:49-07:00","id":207481,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JimB</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/207354-emperor-for-a-day?p=207422#post207422\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">so I'd drop that idea immediately for fear of making things worse.</div> </div> </div> </div>If only those with power had your restraint. I shall say no more to prevent a flamewar.<br /> <br /> Otherwise yeah, those other ideas are pretty good. I would especially like to wear fedoras without fear of looking like a tool, but that's mostly because I just want to look like Indiana Jones. Or Darkwing Duck.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm feeling bluuuueeeee~","edited":{"userid":175,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/175-prometheus878","user":"Prometheus878","date":". 07-24-2014, 07:56 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/175-prometheus878","name":"Prometheus878","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar175_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1477"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-24T16:27:24-07:00","id":207645,"title":"","content":"1) Ask said Alien Space Bats if it would be okay if I genetically spliced myself with their genetic makeup, as I would likely feel more handsome and confident thereafter. Also, I'd enquire about any secrets to regeneration and/or immortality.<br /> <br /> If that goes how I hope, I turn in earnest to the task at hand.<br /> <br /> 2) Replace Valentine's Day with The Purge, while EMP devices that I've spread worldwide disrupt all electronic devices, so as to even things out a bit.<br /> <br /> 3) Legalize drugs. All of them.<br /> <br /> 4) Make honest labeling mandatory, the punishment for doing otherwise being that the offending parties have to do the Truffle Shuffle for 72 hours. If they're not jolly enough to shuffle properly, they will be force-fed until plump and truffly.<br /> <br /> 5) Replace every Sunday with Arbor Day. Nobody will even notice.<br /> <br /> \u200b.....hmmm. I'll think of more later. One can never be too psychopathically obsessed with power, after all.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>\u201cNobody is purely good or purely evil. Mo</b></span><b>st of us are in-between. There are moths that explore the day and butterflies that play at night.\u201d </b><br /> - Suzy Kassem, Rise Up and Salute The Sun<br /> <b>(She/Her)</b></span></span>","edited":{"userid":380,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","user":"AzraelFirestorm","date":". 07-24-2014, 07:29 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","name":"AzraelFirestorm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar380_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-24T16:51:08-07:00","id":207708,"title":"","content":"The Purge is a <i>terrible </i>idea.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-24T16:59:01-07:00","id":207720