uilt up of the wealthy to rich and that caters to them. Banking is handled very differently for reasons of bank security and insurance, and if someone wealthy wants to invest they generally do so where ever makes them the most money that they have access to.... so you still kinda have that effect, however it's on a global not a local scale. Which in of itself isn't really a good thing, as it promotes shorter term investments (bearing in mind I'm still talking in years to decades here). An economy booms, you invest in it. Someplace else starts doing better? You switch your investments. The first place that boomed? Hope the locals didn't sink a lot into infrastructure because it's now going into decline and they won't be able to afford to maintain it.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Odd_Canuck is not a topical medication or food product and is not to be taken internally or seriously.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/31-odd_canuck","name":"Odd_Canuck","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar31_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1474"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-28T09:31:08-07:00","id":211320,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Papa Bear</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/207354-emperor-for-a-day?p=211162#post211162\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Because that part never happens. They've been trying the &quot;trickle down&quot; method since the Reagan era. 